Package: patrone-unpack
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apt, pkexec
Recommends: flatpak
Description: Patrone's app for archives, .deb packages and Flatpak apps
 Patrone Unpack opens zip, tar (gzip, xz, bzip2, zstd), 7z and rar
 archives as folders, with Extract all and Extract here, and opens a
 single file from one with a double-click. It also installs .deb packages
 and Flatpak apps: it shows what a package is, its version and size and
 what else it needs, and installs it for everyone once an administrator's
 password is given.
